# PROVENANCE: Synthetic regression converted from the former unit test
# test_iso_dep_enforces_and_echoes_cid. RATS negotiates CID 3. A frame that
# omits the CID, or carries a different one, is not answered; a chained
# I-block that carries the negotiated CID is acknowledged with an R(ACK) that
# echoes it.
name: ISO-DEP enforces the negotiated CID and echoes it
case-id: vecc-iso-dep-negotiated-cid
origin: synthetic
feature-version: 6
source: converted from tests/test_dfc_virtual_picc_core.c#/iso-dep-enforces-and-echoes-cid
requires: ev3
uid: 04112233445566
picc-generation: EV3
picc-storage: 4096
scan
frame-exchange E083 => 0565810280
expect-error protocol-error frame-exchange 0290
expect-error protocol-error frame-exchange 0A0290
frame-exchange 1A0390 => AA03
field-off
